    "Tell me a task and I'll do it on this iPhone: I see the screen through Screen Mirroring and tap with a USB mouse.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告诉我一个任务，我会在这台 iPhone 上完成：通过屏幕镜像看屏幕，用 USB 鼠标点击。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告訴我一個任務，我會在這臺 iPhone 上完成：透過螢幕映象看螢幕，用 USB 滑鼠點選。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告訴我一個任務，我會在這臺 iPhone 上完成：透過螢幕映象看螢幕，用 USB 滑鼠點選。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tells whether the board, Screen Mirroring, calibration and the model are ready.": {
      "localizations": {
