    "That did not work out. The replay shows where I got stuck.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没成功。回放里能看到我卡在了哪里。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒成功。回放裡能看到我卡在了哪裡。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "沒成功。回放裡能看到我卡在了哪裡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The + button is at the top right of Alarms": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "+ 按钮在“闹钟”页右上角"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "+ 按鈕在“鬧鐘”頁右上角"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "+ 按鈕在“鬧鐘”頁右上角"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board is a USB mouse. iOS shows its pointer only with AssistiveTouch on. Then I calibrate on a grid, like a 3D printer levelling its bed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子是一个 USB 鼠标。只有打开辅助触控，iOS 才会显示它的指针。然后我会在网格上校准，就像 3D 打印机调平热床。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子是一個 USB 滑鼠。只有開啟輔助觸控，iOS 才會顯示它的指標。然後我會在網格上校準，就像 3D 印表機調平熱床。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子是一個 USB 滑鼠。只有開啟輔助觸控，iOS 才會顯示它的指標。然後我會在網格上校準，就像 3D 印表機調平熱床。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board isn't connected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子未连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子未連線。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子未連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board or Screen Mirroring isn't ready. Connect the board and start Screen Mirroring.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子或屏幕镜像还没准备好。请连接板子并开启屏幕镜像。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子或螢幕映象還沒準備好。請連線板子並開啟螢幕映象。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "板子或螢幕映象還沒準備好。請連線板子並開啟螢幕映象。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The board's AirPlay receiver is ported from UxPlay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小板的 AirPlay 接收端移植自 UxPlay。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
